B.abI=new A.eD("Hadith","Amazing is the affair of the believer \u2014 all of it is good for him: if ease reaches him he is grateful, and if hardship strikes him he is patient.","Sahih Muslim 2999 \u2014 excerpt",null,null)
B.abs=new A.eD("Dua","O Allah, I ask You for pardon and well-being in this world and the Hereafter.","Taught by the Prophet \ufdfa \u2014 Sunan Ibn Majah 3871 \u2014 excerpt","sahih","Darussalam")
