B.abh=new A.eD("Door","Sujud al-shukr \u2014 the prostration of gratitude. When a blessing reaches you, fall into prostration.","The practice of the Prophet \ufdfa \u2014 Sunan Abi Dawud 2774 \u2014 sahih per al-Albani",null,null)
